Player's tryMove method relies on 2 arguments, grid and direction
Grid is necessary if we want independence between the entities and grid, ie, i can spawn multiple players
in whichever grid i prefer. However direction from MovableEntity could be used, but we decided that
for testing purposes, as well as design, it would be better that before moving we tell the entity player
where to move, instead of relying on its parent class, allowing for more dynamic movement when the
View phase is implemented.